@AuthFacade_HostAddress = http://localhost:5050

### Health check
GET {{AuthFacade_HostAddress}}/hello
Accept: application/json

### Password grant (replace the placeholders with a real OpenEMR user)
POST {{AuthFacade_HostAddress}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&username=your-username&password=your-password

### Current identity (paste the access_token from the request above)
GET {{AuthFacade_HostAddress}}/me
Authorization: Bearer your-access-token
